    "description": "You are purchasing a \"VTG Tobacciana Lot Meerschaum Lucky Strike Tin Estate Pipes German Smoker +\" in \"Used\" condition.\nFun mixed lot of vintage smoking and decor pieces, perfect for collectors or for adding character to a man cave, bar, or display shelf. You’ll receive everything shown, including: - 3 classic wooden smoking pipes with great aged patina - 2 ashtrays: one carved \"Aloha Hawaii\" souvenir style and one green sailor-themed plate-style ashtray/dish - 1 white ceramic round ashtray - 1 Lucky Strike flat fifties style cigarette tin / case - 1 metal table lighter - 1 small metal knife with rectangular handle (butter or spreader style) - 1 ornate metal candle holder with leaf-like base - 1 charming wooden German figure with beard and green coat. This is a character-filled assortment with a nostalgic vibe—ideal if you love vintage tobacco-related items, rustic decor, or unique conversation pieces. Great as a starter collection or to break up and use in different rooms or displays.\nKeywords: vintage smoking lot, tobacco pipe collection, ashtray set, Lucky Strike tin, bar decor, man cave decor, vintage gnome figurine, metal candle holder, retro lighter, collectible pipes\nAll items show general wear consistent with age and use. The three wooden smoking pipes have darkened bowls, surface wear, and light scuffing to stems and finishes. The green decorative plate with sailor motif shows light surface wear and minor utensil or rub marks. The metal cigarette tin with Lucky Strike design has interior tarnish, surface scratches, and some clouding to the bottom. The small metal knife has surface scratches and patina on the blade and handle. The metal candle holder has heavy patina, darkening, and residue in the cup area. The wooden bearded figure has a broken arm, scuffs, and discoloration.\nCondition Notes:\nAll items show general wear consistent with age and use. The three wooden smoking pipes have darkened bowls, surface wear, and light scu